[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369021966","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111176#issuecomment-3369021966","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111176","id":3369021966,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IzzIO","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-05T12:23:22Z","updated_at":"2025-10-05T12:23:22Z","body":"Made simple MRP with a minor change from the provided sample to also log the `device_id`:  [mrp-111176.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22709533/mrp-111176.zip)\n\nConfirmed normal behaviour on `4.4.1.stable` , where I get the following output on my MRP:\n\n```\n# Scene Starts\nInput.is_joy_known(0) = true # Connect Steam Controller\nInput.is_joy_known(0) = false # Disconnect Steam Controller\nInput.is_joy_known(0) = true # Connect PS5 DualSense\nInput.is_joy_known(0) = false # Disconnect PS5 DualSense\n```\n\nBut on `v4.5.stable.official [876b29033]` and `v4.6.dev.custom_build [06827c91c]`, I get the following output (identical on both versions):\n```\n# Scene Starts\nInput.is_joy_known(0) = false # ??? - Appears instantly\nInput.is_joy_known(1) = false # Connect Steam Controller\nInput.is_joy_known(1) = false # Disconnect Steam Controller\nInput.is_joy_known(1) = false # Connect PS5 DualSense\nInput.is_joy_known(1) = false # Disconnect PS5 DualSense\n```\n\nI don't have an Xbox controller, so I used a Steam Controller (using dongle, without Steam open) and a PS5 DualSense controller (via USB cable) for my tests.\n\n```\nGodot v4.5.stable - Pop!_OS 22.04 LTS on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (nvidia; 575.64.05) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.28 GiB memory\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3369021966/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383254858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111176#issuecomment-3383254858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111176","id":3383254858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JqF9K","user":{"login":"JestemStefan","id":37214990,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjE0OTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37214990?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan","html_url":"https://github.com/JestemStefan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T21:12:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T21:12:51Z","body":"It seems to be an issue with mapping.\n\nI added mock joy mapping manually using \n\n```\nfunc on_joy_connection_changed(device_id: int, is_joy_connected: bool):\n\tvar device_guid = Input.get_joy_guid(device_id)\n\tInput.add_joy_mapping(device_guid, true)\n\t\n\tif Input.is_joy_known(device_id):\n\t\tprint(\"Input.is_joy_known(%d) = true\" % device_id)\n\telse:\n\t\tprint(\"Input.is_joy_known(%d) = false\" % device_id)\n```\n\nAnd now output is \n\n`>> Input.is_joy_known(0) = true`\n\nSeems related to [Add support for SDL3 joystick input driver\n](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/0b3496fb4f2acd8896d7db5becd4ba95694d0472#diff-36bce23b89cedd6e50371a6559abce8634a089446652447831be2cf4da1dce10R592)\n\n I will investigate more tomorrow","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383254858/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387009711","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111176#issuecomment-3387009711","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111176","id":3387009711,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J4aqv","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T18:14:55Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T18:14:55Z","body":"cc @Nintorch ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387009711/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387035356","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111176#issuecomment-3387035356","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111176","id":3387035356,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J4g7c","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T18:22:13Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T18:22:13Z","body":"It's indeed related to the SDL3 joystick input driver integration. I think it now returns false because we don't use Godot's older joystick mapping system (SDL3 already handles it for us). I will try to fix it when I can!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387035356/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3388913707","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111176#issuecomment-3388913707","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111176","id":3388913707,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J_rgr","user":{"login":"JestemStefan","id":37214990,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjE0OTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37214990?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan","html_url":"https://github.com/JestemStefan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-10T08:43:48Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T08:43:48Z","body":"@Nintorch I would like to try to find a fix this weekend. Can you guide me in the case I need help?\n\nIf there is no response from me over a weekend then feel free to take it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3388913707/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3388934253","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111176#issuecomment-3388934253","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111176","id":3388934253,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J_wht","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-10T08:50:39Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T08:50:39Z","body":"> @Nintorch I would like to try to find a fix this weekend. Can you guide me in the case I need help?\n> \n> If there is no response from me over a weekend then feel free to take it.\n\nSure! I think `Input.is_joy_known()` is basically equivalent to SDL's [`SDL_IsGamepad()`](https://wiki.libsdl.org/SDL3/SDL_IsGamepad), this function returns true if the device is supported by the gamepad subsystem (i.e. if it has a mapping).\n\nWhat I would do is make a wrapper method for that function inside `JoypadSDL` class and then call that method in `Input` class if `SDL_ENABLED` if defined, otherwise use the existing functionality.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3388934253/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3388964131","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111176#issuecomment-3388964131","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111176","id":3388964131,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J_30j","user":{"login":"JestemStefan","id":37214990,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjE0OTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37214990?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan","html_url":"https://github.com/JestemStefan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JestemStefan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-10T08:58:09Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T08:58:09Z","body":"Ok. I will take a look at your approach.\n\nMy initial idea was to modify condition in `is_joy_known`.\n\nThere is this variable `mapping_handled` that exists in joy_info.\nCurrently it's removed with a comment that it serves no purpose. We can keep it and use it here.\n\nSomething like: (I was typing that on the phone)\n```\nbool Input::is_joy_known(int p_device) {\n\tif (joy_names.has(p_device)) {\n                 if joy_names[p_device].info.get(\"mapping_handled\", false) {\n                         return true;\n                 }\n\t\tint mapping = joy_names[p_device].mapping;\n\t\tif (mapping != -1 && mapping != fallback_mapping) {\n\t\t\treturn true;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\treturn false;\n}\n```\n\nI'm still learning C++ and how godot code works so please let me know what you think about this approach","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3388964131/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3388979415","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111176#issuecomment-3388979415","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111176","id":3388979415,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J_7jX","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-10T09:03:11Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T09:03:11Z","body":"I think this might work too, but JoypadSDL's code will also need to be modified a bit to only add the mapping_handled field if SDL_IsGamepad() returns true, and it would also add a new field to `Input.get_joy_info()` method (the mapping_handled field), so the documentation for that method will also need to be modified ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3388979415/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]